  "adaptations": [
    "Checked handles, typed messages, shared bounded projectile flight and deferred cleanup replace legacy services.",
    "Thief and Naga missing-head skeletons use explicit body damage, as BoneLeech does.",
    "Clear ground-ray misses preserve source initial positions; bounded model-overlap escape permits vertical candidates.",
    "Zealot enables solid body checking at the teleport movement boundary before reappearance.",
    "Shockwave ground ray initializes its previously undefined endpoint; zero-distance radial direction is finite.",
    "DeathRay reflection work is bounded to 64 bounces; fragment direction magnitudes are converted to equivalent normalized directions and effective speed.",
    "World SPR keeps first-frame UV periods across native-sized frames; later renderer reference, not a 1998 trace.",
    "Sky slot replacement and persistent INSKY membership follow the later engine reference.",
    "Absent shiklung1 model and empty built-in sprite are explicit resource omissions.",
    "Only the exact explicit DLS1 default velocity edge is accepted; existing squared velocity gain is applied once. Release bound increases from 20 to 60 seconds for Track1 6387-timecent release."
  ],
